abstract: >-
  ExergyNet decouples persistent memory from active context delivery.
  As stored state scales toward and beyond 100 million tokens, the delivered
  context per query remains bounded — by design, not by limitation. V5
  characterizes this relationship at a development operating point, presents
  retrieval performance data from a live environment, examines accelerator
  infrastructure behavior at that operating point, and reports a live
  authority-layer result from a production-adjacent environment.
